  "prefLabel": "Csp 402.06 Expected family contribution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 402.06 “Expected family contribution” means the amount, determined by a formula established in Part F of Title IV of the Higher Education Act of 1965, as amended, that a student and his or her spouse and family are expected to contribute toward the student’s cost of attendance.\n\nSource. #13144, eff 12-9-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Csp 400); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
